        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Activities",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.figment.io/solana/activities",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "network",
                "value": "mainnet",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "type",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter by activity type."
              },
              {
                "name": "status",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter by activity-life status."
              },
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Returns Solana staking activities for the authenticated organization.\n\n## Activity types\n\n| `type`         | Description |\n|----------------|-------------|\n| `delegation`   | Stake account delegated to a validator |\n| `undelegation` | Stake account deactivated and removed from validator |\n| `withdrawal`   | SOL withdrawn back to wallet after cooldown |\n\nAll Solana activities are on-chain. `tx.status` reflects the transaction status\n(`in_progress`, `confirmed`, `failed`, `expired`).\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Activity",
            "type": "http"
          },
